{"seq":3,"slug":"synthetic-interleaving-quality","title":"Interleaving 与小流量质量敏感度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-relevance-online-monitoring/online-relevance-metric/synthetic-interleaving-quality","wordCount":2811,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"interleaving-与小流量质量敏感度量\">Interleaving 与小流量质量敏感度量</h1><p>前两篇的方法都建立在一个前提上：<strong>有足够的行为数据可以把噪声压下去</strong>。当一个新市场刚开通、一个品类刚上线、或者一次实验还在 1% 灰度时，这个前提不成立——每天几百次曝光，点击率的置信区间宽到可以同时容纳「提升 20%」和「下降 20%」。此时任何基于点击率对比的结论都是掷硬币。</p>\n<p>这一篇处理的就是这类<strong>样本稀缺但决策不能等</strong>的场景。两个方向：<strong>用交错实验换取样本效率</strong>，以及<strong>用合成 query 集构造可控探针</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-小流量下-a-b-为何不可用\">核心概念：小流量下 A/B 为何不可用</h2><p>先把这个直觉量化。两个版本各分到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 次曝光，基线点击率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，要检出的相对提升为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>，所需的单组样本量近似为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mi>δ</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\approx \\frac{2 p (1-p) (z_{1-\\alpha/2} + z_{1-\\beta})^2}{(p\\delta)^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4953em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5593em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7452em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = 0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>（相对提升 5%）、显著性 0.05、功效 0.8，得到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>240000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\approx 240000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">240000</span></span></span></span></span>。也就是说要检出 5% 的相对点击率提升，每组需要约 24 万次曝光。一个每天只有 800 次曝光的新市场，跑完需要 600 天。这就是小流量场景的真实处境：<strong>不是实验设计得不好，是问题本身在这个样本量下不可回答</strong>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[质量改动] --&gt; B{该切片日均曝光量}&#10;  B --&gt;|&gt;10万| C[A/B 实验]&#10;  B --&gt;|1万-10万| D[延长实验周期 + 分层分析]&#10;  B --&gt;|1000-1万| E[Interleaving 交错实验]&#10;  B --&gt;|&lt;1000| F[合成 query 集探针 + 人工抽检]&#10;  C --&gt; G[业务指标判定]&#10;  E --&gt; H[偏好方向判定]&#10;  F --&gt; I[定向风险排查]\">graph TD\n  A[质量改动] --&gt; B{该切片日均曝光量}\n  B --&gt;|&gt;10万| C[A/B 实验]\n  B --&gt;|1万-10万| D[延长实验周期 + 分层分析]\n  B --&gt;|1000-1万| E[Interleaving 交错实验]\n  B --&gt;|&lt;1000| F[合成 query 集探针 + 人工抽检]\n  C --&gt; G[业务指标判定]\n  E --&gt; H[偏好方向判定]\n  F --&gt; I[定向风险排查]</pre><p>三种手段的边界不是绝对的，但有一个大致规律：<strong>流量越低，就越需要把「测量用户偏好」换成「测量系统的确定性缺陷」</strong>。A/B 和 interleaving 都在测量用户偏好，前者统计效率低，后者高；而合成 query 集不测量偏好，它测量的是「在已知正确结果的情况下系统有没有给出错误结果」——这是一个可以在极小样本甚至零样本下回答的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"interleaving-的样本效率来源\">Interleaving 的样本效率来源</h2><p>交错实验（interleaving）的操作是：对同一次搜索请求，同时用排序 A 和排序 B 产生两个列表，把两者交错成一个列表展示给用户，然后根据用户的点击把胜负归属回 A 或 B。由于<strong>同一个用户在同一个请求上同时面对两个版本</strong>，用户间的方差被完全消除，只剩下版本间的差异。</p>\n<p>这个方差消除的量级是可观的。评估交错方法效率的理论分析指出，在典型设置下交错比较所需的样本量比标准 A/B 低一个数量级以上（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.10023\">Theoretical Analysis on the Efficiency of Interleaved Comparisons</a>，arXiv:2306.10023）。统计检验的构造也有专门研究，例如用加权假设检验改进交错结果的估计量（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2303.10094\">Stat-weight: Improving the Estimator of Interleaved Methods Outcomes with Statistical Hypothesis Testing</a>，arXiv:2303.10094）。</p>\n<p>对跨国电商的小流量切片，interleaving 还有一个额外优势：<strong>它天然按市场/语言分层</strong>。因为每个用户只在同一个市场内被交错比较，印尼语流量不会污染泰语流量的结论——这一点在 A/B 里需要额外做分层分析才能达到。</p>\n<h3 id=\"交错算法的选择\">交错算法的选择</h3><p>不同的交错算法有不同的偏差特征，选错了会得到系统性误导的结论。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>交错方式</th>\n<th>已知偏差</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Balanced</td>\n<td>按位置交替从 A、B 取项</td>\n<td>破坏列表内部一致性</td>\n<td>快速排查，非正式结论</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Team-Draft</td>\n<td>模拟选秀轮流挑项，点击归属队</td>\n<td>偏向多样性高的列表</td>\n<td>通用首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Probabilistic</td>\n<td>每个位置按概率采样来源</td>\n<td>需更多会话才达同等功效</td>\n<td>对无偏性要求极高的场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Team-Draft Interleaving</strong> 是实践中最常用的。它的偏差——偏向多样性更好的列表——在电商场景下通常与业务目标同向（用户确实喜欢不重复的结果），但对<strong>导航型 query</strong> 会给出错误信号：用户明确要找某个型号时，「相关性等价但更杂」的列表不应该被判胜。工程上的处理是<strong>只在探索型 query 上启用 interleaving</strong>，导航型 query 交给离线标注集或 A/B。</p>\n<p>一个关键的落地约束是：<strong>必须记录每一项的来源版本</strong>。如果靠位置去推断归属，一旦交错逻辑或降级逻辑有偏差，归属就会系统性出错，而错误的归属产生的是看起来合理但完全无效的结论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"合成-query-集-不测偏好-测缺陷\">合成 query 集：不测偏好，测缺陷</h2><p>当流量低到连 interleaving 都跑不动时（例如每天不足 1000 次曝光的新市场），唯一可行的方向是<strong>构造一个不依赖真实流量的探针</strong>。合成 query 集（synthetic query set）就是这个探针。</p>\n<p>它的构造逻辑是：不随机采样真实 query，而是<strong>按预设的意图类别与属性组合系统地枚举 query</strong>，然后对每条 query 预先确定「正确答案应该满足什么条件」。这样做的关键收益是：<strong>每一条 query 都有明确的通过/失败判据，不需要统计聚合</strong>。一条 query 失败了就是失败了，不需要等 24 万次曝光。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;set_id&quot;: &quot;synth_id_phonecase_v3&quot;,&#10;  &quot;market&quot;: &quot;ID&quot;,&#10;  &quot;locale&quot;: &quot;id-ID&quot;,&#10;  &quot;created&quot;: &quot;2026-09-15&quot;,&#10;  &quot;intent_coverage&quot;: [&quot;brand+model&quot;, &quot;attribute-only&quot;, &quot;misspelling&quot;, &quot;code-switch&quot;],&#10;  &quot;cases&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;query&quot;: &quot;casing iphone 15 pro max&quot;,&#10;      &quot;intent&quot;: &quot;brand+model&quot;,&#10;      &quot;expect&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;must_match_all&quot;: [&quot;iphone&quot;, &quot;15&quot;, &quot;pro max&quot;],&#10;        &quot;must_match_any&quot;: [&quot;casing&quot;, &quot;case&quot;, &quot;cover&quot;],&#10;        &quot;min_results&quot;: 5&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;block&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;query&quot;: &quot;sarung hp murah&quot;,&#10;      &quot;intent&quot;: &quot;attribute-only&quot;,&#10;      &quot;expect&quot;: { &quot;must_match_any&quot;: [&quot;sarung&quot;, &quot;case&quot;, &quot;casing&quot;], &quot;price_max&quot;: 100000, &quot;min_results&quot;: 3 },&#10;      &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;high&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;query&quot;: &quot;iphone ケース&quot;,&#10;      &quot;intent&quot;: &quot;code-switch&quot;,&#10;      &quot;expect&quot;: { &quot;must_match_all&quot;: [&quot;iphone&quot;], &quot;min_results&quot;: 3 },&#10;      &quot;severity&quot;: &quot;high&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"set_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"synth_id_phonecase_v3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ID\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"locale\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"id-ID\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"created\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-15\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"intent_coverage\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"brand+model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"attribute-only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"misspelling\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"code-switch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cases\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"casing iphone 15 pro max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"intent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"brand+model\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"expect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"must_match_all\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"iphone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"15\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pro max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"must_match_any\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"casing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"case\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cover\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"min_results\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"block\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sarung hp murah\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"intent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"attribute-only\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"expect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"must_match_any\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sarung\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"case\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"casing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"price_max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_results\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"query\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"iphone ケース\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"intent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"code-switch\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"expect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"must_match_all\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"iphone\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min_results\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"severity\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"high\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>两类判据值得区分，它们对应的排查方向与负责人完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据类型</th>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>检测的缺陷层</th>\n<th>失败后的动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬判据</td>\n<td>must_match_all / must_match_any</td>\n<td>召回与分词</td>\n<td>直接进工单，按 block 级处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软判据</td>\n<td>min_results / price_max</td>\n<td>覆盖度与过滤规则</td>\n<td>进人工复核队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>负向判据</td>\n<td>must_not_match</td>\n<td>违禁词、错配品类</td>\n<td>直接进工单，按 high 级处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>硬判据</strong>（must_match_all / must_match_any）检验的是召回与分词层面的确定性缺陷。如果搜「iphone 15 pro max casing」返回的结果里没有一个标题同时含有这几个词，那这就是一个确定的失败，与流量多少无关。</li>\n<li><strong>软判据</strong>（min_results / price_max）检验的是覆盖度与过滤规则的合理性。这类判据可能有正当的业务例外（比如确实没有低于 10 万印尼盾的合规产品），所以失败时进人工复核而不是直接报错。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>合成 query 集的<strong>构造纪律</strong>是它必须来自对真实失败模式的抽象，而不是凭空想象。可行的方式是：从 <a href=\"../badcase-detect-cluster/badcase-auto-cluster\">Badcase 自动聚簇</a> 得到的簇中提炼出意图类别，再按类别枚举组合。凭空构造的 query 集通常测不出真问题，因为设计者想不出自己系统真正的弱点。</p>\n<h3 id=\"合成集的自我校验\">合成集的自我校验</h3><p>一个常见的反模式是：合成集构造出来后自我验证「在构造它的那个版本上通过率 100%」，然后就不再维护。有效的做法是<strong>给它加负例</strong>：故意放入几条预期会失败的 query，如果它们也「通过」了，说明判据太松、探针失效。这与 <a href=\"../quality-governance-loop/fix-verify-regression-link\">修复验证与回归集联动</a> 中回归集需要定期检出自失效的做法是同一个纪律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三者的组合与优先级\">三者的组合与优先级</h2><p>小流量切片的度量体系不是三选一，而是分层配合。下表给出一个可落地的分工。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>手段</th>\n<th>频率</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>持续哨兵</td>\n<td>合成 query 集</td>\n<td>每次发布后自动跑</td>\n<td>有没有确定性的硬缺陷</td>\n<td>通过/失败清单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>方向判定</td>\n<td>Interleaving</td>\n<td>每次有候选版本时</td>\n<td>用户更偏好哪个版本</td>\n<td>偏好胜负 + 置信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效果量化</td>\n<td>A/B（或延长实验）</td>\n<td>积累够流量后</td>\n<td>业务指标是否真的提升</td>\n<td>业务收益</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>兜底</td>\n<td>人工抽检</td>\n<td>按周期或按需</td>\n<td>自动化判据覆盖不到的问题</td>\n<td>抽检报告</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>优先级上有一条实用规则：<strong>先跑合成集再跑 interleaving</strong>。理由是合成集的成本接近于零且能挡住硬缺陷——如果一个版本的召回缺陷会让「iphone 15 pro max」搜不到货，那么花流量去跑 interleaving 判偏好是浪费，因为这样的版本无论如何都不该上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[候选版本] --&gt; B[合成 query 集]&#10;  B --&gt;|有 block 级失败| C[打回,附失败 query 清单]&#10;  B --&gt;|通过| D{该切片日均曝光 &gt; 1000}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[Interleaving 判偏好方向]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[扩大合成集 + 人工抽检]&#10;  E --&gt;|负向| C&#10;  E --&gt;|正向| G{累计流量够 A/B}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[在线 A/B 量化业务收益]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[灰度放量,持续观察]&#10;  H --&gt; J[放量或回滚]\">graph TD\n  A[候选版本] --&gt; B[合成 query 集]\n  B --&gt;|有 block 级失败| C[打回,附失败 query 清单]\n  B --&gt;|通过| D{该切片日均曝光 &gt; 1000}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[Interleaving 判偏好方向]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[扩大合成集 + 人工抽检]\n  E --&gt;|负向| C\n  E --&gt;|正向| G{累计流量够 A/B}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[在线 A/B 量化业务收益]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[灰度放量,持续观察]\n  H --&gt; J[放量或回滚]</pre><p>反过来，合成集通过也不代表可以上：它只能证明「已知的失败模式没有复发」，证明不了「新版本比旧版本更好」。这两件事必须由 interleaving 或 A/B 承担。</p>\n<h3 id=\"判定与统计实现\">判定与统计实现</h3><p>交错实验的判定单元是<strong>会话</strong>而不是请求，因为同一用户在多次请求上的偏好是相关的。判定逻辑是：一次会话内统计归属于 A 的点击数与归属于 B 的点击数，多者胜；相等记为平局并丢弃。跨会话汇总后用二项检验判断 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = 0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span> 是否被拒绝。下面的伪代码把归属、判定与显著性检验串起来。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def judge_session(events, source_of):&#10;    # events: 该会话内所有点击事件; source_of: 记录每项来源版本的映射&#10;    wins = {&quot;A&quot;: 0, &quot;B&quot;: 0}&#10;    for ev in events:&#10;        if ev.type != &quot;click&quot;:&#10;            continue&#10;        wins[source_of[ev.item_id]] += 1&#10;    if wins[&quot;A&quot;] == wins[&quot;B&quot;]:&#10;        return None                       # 平局丢弃&#10;    return &quot;A&quot; if wins[&quot;A&quot;] &gt; wins[&quot;B&quot;] else &quot;B&quot;&#10;&#10;def interleaving_significance(session_verdicts):&#10;    n = len(session_verdicts)&#10;    k = sum(1 for v in session_verdicts if v == &quot;A&quot;)&#10;    # 双侧二项检验, 原假设 p=0.5&#10;    return {&quot;sessions&quot;: n, &quot;a_win_rate&quot;: k / n if n else None,&#10;            &quot;p_value&quot;: 2 * binom_sf(max(k, n - k) - 1, n, 0.5)}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> judge_session</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(events, source_of):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # events: 该会话内所有点击事件; source_of: 记录每项来源版本的映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    wins </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ev </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> events:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ev.type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"click\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            continue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        wins[source_of[ev.item_id]] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wins[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wins[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                       # 平局丢弃</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wins[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wins[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"B\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> interleaving_significance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(session_verdicts):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(session_verdicts)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> session_verdicts </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 双侧二项检验, 原假设 p=0.5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sessions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: n, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"a_win_rate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"p_value\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> binom_sf(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(k, n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>平局率是效率杀手</strong>，也是小流量场景下最需要监控的量：如果一次会话内用户没有任何点击，或两侧点击相等，这次会话不贡献信息。移动端结果页的平局率经常超过 50%，这是交错实验在移动端效率低于桌面端的主要原因。降低平局率的手段包括使用更细粒度的判定（考虑点击位置而不只是计数）、以及把会话边界定义得稍长以包含更多点击机会——但会话边界一旦放宽，就必须与 <a href=\"implicit-feedback-proxy-metric\">隐式反馈代理指标</a> 中定义的切分规则保持一致，否则两套度量无法互相印证。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与偏差校正的关系\">与偏差校正的关系</h3><p>需要小心一个交叉点：interleaving 与 <a href=\"online-ndcg-estimation\">在线 NDCG 的倾向性校正</a> 解决的是同一个问题的两面。interleaving 通过实验设计<strong>在采集阶段避免偏差</strong>（两个版本在同一位置、同一用户面前比较），反事实估计通过统计手段<strong>在分析阶段消除偏差</strong>。当两者结论不一致时，优先信任 interleaving——因为它的偏差控制不依赖于任何模型假设，而倾向性估计依赖检验假设成立。这个优先级顺序在 <a href=\"../rootcause-diagnosis/recall-rank-data-attribution\">根因诊断</a> 中会被反复用到。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>小流量切片下 A/B 不可用是可以量化的：检出 5% 相对提升约需每组 24 万次曝光，日均 800 次曝光的市场需要 600 天。</li>\n<li>流量越低，越应把「测量用户偏好」换成「测量系统的确定性缺陷」——后者可在极小样本甚至零样本下回答。</li>\n<li>Interleaving 通过同一用户面对两个排序消除用户间方差，理论分析显示所需样本比 A/B 低一个数量级以上，且天然按市场分层。</li>\n<li>Team-Draft 最常用但偏向多样性好的列表，导航型 query 禁用；必须记录每一项的来源版本以保证归属正确。</li>\n<li>合成 query 集按意图类别系统枚举，用硬判据（must_match_all/any）捕捉确定性缺陷、软判据（min_results）捕捉覆盖度问题。</li>\n<li>合成集必须来自真实 badcase 簇的抽象，并加入预期失败的负例来自我校验。</li>\n<li>执行顺序为：合成集挡住硬缺陷 → interleaving 判偏好方向 → A/B 量化业务收益；结论冲突时优先信任 interleaving。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Interleaving 与小流量质量敏感度量","id":"interleaving-与小流量质量敏感度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：小流量下 A/B 为何不可用","id":"核心概念-小流量下-a-b-为何不可用"},{"level":2,"text":"Interleaving 的样本效率来源","id":"interleaving-的样本效率来源"},{"level":3,"text":"交错算法的选择","id":"交错算法的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"合成 query 集：不测偏好，测缺陷","id":"合成-query-集-不测偏好-测缺陷"},{"level":3,"text":"合成集的自我校验","id":"合成集的自我校验"},{"level":2,"text":"三者的组合与优先级","id":"三者的组合与优先级"},{"level":3,"text":"判定与统计实现","id":"判定与统计实现"},{"level":3,"text":"与偏差校正的关系","id":"与偏差校正的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"在线 NDCG/DCG 的估计方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-relevance-online-monitoring/online-relevance-metric/online-ndcg-estimation"},"next":{"title":"Badcase 自动聚簇与模式发现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/search-relevance-online-monitoring/badcase-detect-cluster/badcase-auto-cluster"}}